<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Bulk Import & Export</h1>

<h2>Import Links from CSV</h2>
<p>Upload a CSV file to create hundreds of links at once.</p>
<h3>CSV Format</h3>
<pre>destination_url,slug,utm_source,utm_medium,utm_campaign
https://example.com/page1,summer-1,facebook,cpc,summer-2026
https://example.com/page2,summer-2,google,cpc,summer-2026</pre>

<h3>Steps</h3>
<ol><li>Go to <strong>Links → Import</strong> (or use the 📤 icon in the top bar)</li><li>Upload your CSV file</li><li>Review the preview</li><li>Click <strong>Import</strong></li></ol>

<h2>Export Links</h2>
<p>Download all your workspace links as a CSV file:</p>
<ol><li>Go to <strong>Links → Export</strong> (or use the 📥 icon)</li><li>Your CSV will download with all link data including click counts</li></ol>
